<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 million marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo adds 500 million marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Commerzbank, DG Bank and Dresdner said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.755   PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY 1.0 BLN MARKS</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 476</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
